    with q_i ≤ x^c, compute `π(x; q_i, a_i)` for all i. Single-(q, a)
    queries are well-studied; *batched* on Q is not.
    
    **Status: CLOSED-B at S231 (Thread 6 final wrap).** P1 closes
    negatively across all four amortisation axes:
